            "review_title": "Review at Lovegan",
            "review_text": "Mario&Sandy\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam57 contributions\n0\nA Gem of a Vegan Cafe\nDec 2020 • Couples\nLiterally hidden in a small Vietnamese community courtyard. This gem of a Vegan cafe is at the top of our list! Owned and operated by a very sweet husband and wife, their cleverly chosen name says it all...Lovegan. The menu is not pretentious but the food, juices and desserts we tried were prepared to perfection. My wife and I loved it so much we are going back in a few days. Highly recommended for a great meal and chill environment.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 24, 2020",
