            "review_title": "Review at Lovegan",
            "review_text": "Jas R\n7 contributions\n0\nFavorite restaurant in Hanoi!\nOct 2019 • Friends\nWhen i came to Hanoi i was firstly excited to visit Vietnam but also worried about the possible vegetarian/vegan food avaliable. By luck i found this lovely cafe on Google maps and was happily surprised by the amazing food and service! We ate a banh mi baguette with tempeh and a miso soup! It is so lovely as i feel i can experience some of Vietnamese food with a vegan twist! Would highly recommend and i cannot wait to return. The juices are also so fresh and amazing! It is on a side street from the Google location but very easy to find! Thank you once again!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 12, 2019",
