            "review_text": "Caroline D\nBudapest 9 contributions\n0\nBest vegan food in Hanoi\nJan 2019 • Couples\nLovegan has become one of my favourite places in Hanoi after only visiting twice. This is a small, friendly place. The food is so fresh and extremely tasty. Since becoming vegetarian/vegan I have missed being able to enjoy traditional Vietnamese street food. However, lovegan combines Vietnamese food and vegan food, and they do an amazing job with it! The Banh Mi's and the fresh spring rolls are amazing! The combination of flavours are great, and the bread is fresh and crispy. I have also tried one of their soups, and it was great. The broth was very tasty. Their food is also very reasonably priced, especially for a vegan establishment. The owners of Lovegan and lovely and friendly. They also sell various products. I would highly recommend this place for everyone!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 5, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
