            "review_text": "Imanol Becerra Valls\nSant Feliu de Llobregat, Spain18 contributions\n0\nBest vegan restaurant in Hanoi\nJan 2019 • Couples\nYesterday we found Lovegan and today we repeat. Small, quiet and cozy place. Here you feel like at home. Far away the noise. You will only hear relaxing music and the lovely cooking sound. The food is tasty, the best we have tried in Hanoi. Don't miss it! You will repeat for sure 💚 Pictures: miso noodle soup, dumpling soup and pesto pizza 😋\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 9, 2019",
