            "review_text": "samrey\nFranschhoek, South Africa114 contributions\n1\nOne of my fave places in Hanoi!\nOct 2018 • Couples\nWe ate here so many times and it was always delicious. Their hummus pizza is unbelievable!! Made with homemade hummus (or pesto) and lots of roasted veggies it was one of the best meals in Vietnam! Their rye bread baguette sandwiches are delicious and generous and their mango smoothie and chocolate are amazing! This tiny place is run by a young Vietnamese Buddhist couple who are truly lovely human beings. They make their food with love! All the food is refined sugar-free, no additives, chemicals or MSG. Please go and treat yourself!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 24, 2018",
