            "review_text": "Ross du Toit\n16 contributions\n0\nA must visit for fresh, healthy food.\nJun 2018\nI went to Lovegan to buy some protein powder, While there I decided to try their lentil Banh mi and homemade kombucha, both were incredible. I spent the morning chatting to the friendly owners, Trang and Huy who are both passionate about their business and eager for it to grow. I couldn’t resist ordering the tempeh Banh mi for takeaway, which was also delicious.\nThey sell lots of vegan products including seeds, nuts and homemade tahini and peanut butter, amongst others. \nSo if you are vegan, vegetarian or you just really enjoy fresh, healthy, awesome food I would highly recommend going to Lovegan and helping their small business grow.\nRead more\nWritten June 27, 2018",
